{"hash": "7b7a4bc9053a7dd2", "text": "Sending stones to the station is a push, and it's a decision. As of October 2026, Claude Code's auto mode allows pushing to any branch of the repository you're in, the default branch included. A branch named like a deploy target, such as production, is judged on its own, and the remote's own branch protection still applies. A public remote is the station's noticeboard, facing the road, read by anyone passing. In late September, Glow Labs researchers found coding agents that, unable to attach an image where they were working, put internal screenshots in public GitHub repositories instead. One helper's default creates a public repository. The researchers counted more than thirteen thousand images from over three hundred organisations: their own count, not an independent audit. Auto mode blocks pushing secrets or personal data to a repository known to be public. If it can't tell, that alone won't stop a push; files marked sensitive are blocked either way. Whether yours is public is yours to know.", "alignment": {"characters": ["S", "e", "n", "d", "i", "n", "g", " ", "s", "t", "o", "n", "e", "s", " ", "t", "o", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "s", "t", "a", "t", "i", "o", "n", " ", "i", "s", " ", "a", " ", "p", "u", "s", "h", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "i", "t", "'", "s", " ", "a", " ", "d", "e", "c", "i", "s", "i", "o", "n", ".", " ", "A", "s", " ", "o", "f", " ", "O", "c", "t", "o", "b", "e", "r", " ", "2", "0", "2", "6", ",", " ", "C", "l", "a", "u", "d", "e", " ", "C", "o", "d", "e", "'", "s", " ", "a", "u", "t", "o", " ", "m", "o", "d", "e", " ", "a", "l", "l", "o", "w", "s", " ", "p", "u", "s", "h", "i", "n", "g", " ", "t", "o", " ", "a", "n", "y", " ", "b", "r", "a", "n", "c", "h", " ", "o", "f", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "r", "e", "p", "o", "s", "i", "t", "o", "r", "y", " ", "y", "o", "u", "'", "r", "e", " ", "i", "n", ",", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "d", "e", "f", "a", "u", "l", "t", " ", "b", "r", "a", "n", "c", "h", " ", "i", "n